   $q$Which is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Librarians lead teams of students who shovel at night after each storm. The library pays them for each home, and the program has stayed the same size.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"After learning that snowy sidewalks trapped some neighbors at home, a sixth-grade class formed the Snow Shovel Squad. Using a library sign-up list and safety rules, it has grown to help over ninety homes.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Students in the squad work only in daylight and always with an adult. They take a break every thirty minutes and bend their knees when lifting snow.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"The Snow Shovel Squad is the kindest group of students in the whole country. Every school should copy Maple Hollow and start its own squad right away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$After learning that snowy sidewalks trapped some neighbors at home, a sixth-grade class formed the Snow Shovel Squad. Using a library sign-up list and safety rules, it has grown to help over ninety homes.$q$, $q$The choice beginning "After learning that snowy sidewalks trapped some neighbors" covers why the squad started, how it works and how it has grown, without opinions. The choice about daylight, breaks and bending knees is accurate but sums up only the safety paragraph.$q$, 'draft', 'dde7c400-2cce-5619-acc1-79347f01f8da')
