  ('f0771b83-e201-512f-8c3a-550e1aa57199', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g6-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$What does the speaker mean by the lines "A speck can still look out and learn / the secrets of the sky"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Even though people are tiny compared to space, they can still explore and understand it.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The telescope was broken, so the speaker saw only a small speck.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The speaker wants to keep what was seen a secret from others.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-word"},{"text":"Only very small children are able to see the stars clearly.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Even though people are tiny compared to space, they can still explore and understand it.$q$, $q$The "speck" is the speaker, who is small but can still learn about the stars, which is the heart of the theme. "Secrets" refers to the mysteries of space, not to something the speaker hides.$q$, 'draft', 'f0c7f22a-0c88-5440-a63c-8da729bb5b11')
