   $q$Which reason does the survey of 35 Westbrook teachers support?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Parents can always reach the front office by phone.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"},{"text":"Students would talk more with each other at lunch.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"},{"text":"Phones distract students and interrupt lessons.","is_correct":true},{"text":"A locker rule would raise math test scores.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Phones distract students and interrupt lessons.$q$, $q$The survey appears in the paragraph that begins "The main problem is distraction," and 30 teachers said phones interrupt lessons daily. The test scores come from Ashby, which supports the reason about grades.$q$, 'draft', '74bc284e-e718-5160-847f-499e25e1c7d6')
