   $q$What does the author want readers to do?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Ask the town to collect more bags of yard waste each fall.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Rake every leaf from the lawn as early in the fall as possible.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Leave at least some fallen leaves on the ground through the winter.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Plant more trees so that yards will have more leaves next year.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Leave at least some fallen leaves on the ground through the winter.$q$, $q$The author says homeowners "should leave at least some fallen leaves on the ground through the winter." Raking every leaf is the habit the author argues against.$q$, 'draft', '01ba47a1-7811-5fb6-8e7f-90c7299862e4')
