   $q$The detail about Pinecrest's 900 tons of yard waste supports which reason?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A layer of leaves keeps the soil from drying out in winter.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"},{"text":"Fallen leaves give salamanders and beetles a place to hide.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"},{"text":"Bagging leaves creates waste and uses fuel to haul it away.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Many people think a yard full of leaves looks very messy.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-counterclaim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Bagging leaves creates waste and uses fuel to haul it away.$q$, $q$The Pinecrest figure appears in the paragraph that begins "Bagging leaves creates waste, too," and the trucks burning fuel add to that point. It says nothing about animals or soil.$q$, 'draft', '01ba47a1-7811-5fb6-8e7f-90c7299862e4')
