   $q$What is the author's main claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Teachers should give a three-question quiz at the start of each class.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Students would remember more by quizzing themselves than by rereading.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Students should learn more about volcanoes in their science classes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Students should reread their notes several times before every test.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Students would remember more by quizzing themselves than by rereading.$q$, $q$The first paragraph states that "students would remember more if they spent that time quizzing themselves instead." Mr. Adeyemi's daily quiz is one example used as support, not the main claim.$q$, 'draft', '7b3d51ac-2729-566d-8092-73d5770ad2eb')
